    "original": "「お前が折った木の種類わかるか？」「いや知らない」刑事に問われ俺は答えた。刑事は開いたドアの方を見ながら「おい、こいつの折った木の種類わかるか？」と声を上げた。「えっと、槙らしいです」と若い女性の声。刑事は居住まいを正すと「お前が折った木の種類わかるか？」ともう一度聞いた。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1487712",
        "text": "\"Do you know what kind of tree you just broke?\" \"No, I don't,\" I answered the detective. While looking through the open door, the detective shouted, \"Hey, do you know what kind of tree he just broke?\" \"Um, looks like it's a yew plum pine,\" said the voice of a young woman. After straightening himself in his seat, the detective asked me one more time: \"Do you know what kind of tree you just broke?\""
      }
